WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.974
1. Open the supplier and choose Documents, then Add document.

2
00:00:03.974 --> 00:00:11.605
2. Choose the Kind, choose the file and, if it expires, the date. Click Upload.

3
00:00:11.605 --> 00:00:14.607
3. Tick Remind me before it expires to get an email 60 and 30 days before. Anyone can tick it for themselves.

4
00:00:14.607 --> 00:00:24.556
4. When a renewed one arrives, click New version and give its new expiry date. The earlier version is kept.
